<!-- wp:mbn-theme/practice-area-details {"sections":[{"id":"whyHire-default","type":"whyHire","title":{"heading":"Why Hire Hastings & Hastings?","paragraphs":["When facing the profound impact of an amputation injury, it’s essential to work with an experienced attorney to get you the compensation you deserve. Choosing Hastings & Hastings offers many benefits"],"backgroundColor":"bg-white"},"data":{"heading":"","subtitle":"","features":[{"id":"feature1","title":"Trusted by Repeat Clients and Referrals","description":"Most of our business comes from repeat clients, referrals, and other satisfied clients, which shows the deep trust we have built within the community over many years."},{"id":"feature2","title":"Over 40 Years Helping Arizona Injury Victims","description":"We have dedicated more than 40 years to helping victims throughout Arizona, illustrating our long-standing commitment and deep understanding of personal injury law as it pertains specifically to the state."},{"id":"feature3","title":"Accessible Legal Support When You Need It","description":"Accessibility is a priority for us. If you’re unable to come to our office, we’ll arrange for a licensed attorney to visit you wherever it’s most convenient."}],"photoUrl":"","photoId":0,"badge90YearsUrl":"","badge90YearsId":0,"mapBackgroundUrl":"","mapBackgroundId":0,"badgeNoFeeUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/img-founding-atty.jpg","badgeNoFeeId":11049,"freeEvaluationsTitle":"Meet Our Founding Attorney","freeEvaluationsDescription":"Founding attorney David G. Hastings created Hastings & Hastings in 1981. After graduating from the University of Arizona in business administration and law, Mr. Hastings began his legal career working for insurance companies, eventually shifting to represent victims of negligence. Since then, Mr. Hastings has become known as “The Discount King”, nicknamed by the Arizona Business Gazette, because he works hard to save his clients money.\n<br/>\n<br/>\nIn addition to working hard to advocate for his clients, Mr. Hastings is involved in local philanthropy. He is involved in supporting organizations such as Special Olympics Arizona and Phoenix Children’s Hospital, as well as helping build homes in Mexico with 1Mission.","millionsRecoveredTitle":"","millionsRecoveredDescription":""}},{"id":"cta1-default","type":"cta","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"logoUrl":"","logoId":0,"textureUrl":"","textureId":0,"heading":"Start Your Free Consultation","subtext":"Contact the discount accident lawyers at Hastings and Hastings today.","buttonText":"Start your free consultation now!","buttonUrl":"#contact","phoneLabel":"Call Today","phoneNumber":"(480) 480-2929"}},{"id":"afterAccident-default","type":"afterAccident","title":{"heading":"<span class=\"pad-text-blue\">How an Amputation Injury Lawyer</span> Can Help With Your Claim","paragraphs":["The majority of people become easily overwhelmed in the aftermath of a life-altering injury. An amputation injury lawyer will facilitate the entire process and can especially help with:"],"backgroundColor":"bg-white"},"data":{"heading":"Determining Liability","splits":[{"id":"split1","text":"<p>A <a href=\"/\">Phoenix injury lawyer</a> is best positioned to determine whether you have a case and who is most likely to be liable for your damages.</p>","imageUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/img-amputation-1.jpg","imageId":11047,"layout":"text-left"},{"id":"split2","text":"<h3 class=\"pad-section-heading\"><span class=\"pad-text-blue\">Serious Catastrophic Injury Attorneys</span> in Phoenix, Arizona</h3><p>Catastrophic injuries can create consequences that last far beyond the initial accident. Victims may face permanent disability, ongoing medical care, lost income, and major financial stress for the entire family. Hastings & Hastings understands that compensation may be the only means of recovery, which is why documenting the full impact of the injury is critical.</p>","imageUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/img-amputation-1.jpg","imageId":11047,"layout":"image-left"},{"id":"split3","text":"<h3 class=\"pad-section-heading\"><span class=\"pad-text-blue\">Common Types</span> of Catastrophic Injuries</h3>\n<p>Catastrophic injuries can result from serious truck accidents, falls, or many other types of accidents. These injuries can be debilitating, life-changing, and may require ongoing medical care.</p>","imageUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/img-amputation-2.jpg","imageId":11048,"layout":"text-left"}]}},{"id":"compensation-default","type":"compensation","title":{"heading":"<span class=\"pad-text-blue\">How an Attorney</span> Can Help You With an Amputation Injury Case","paragraphs":["Having an experienced attorney to guide you through your amputation injury case is indispensable. Here’s how they can be of assistance:"],"backgroundColor":"bg-gray-50"},"data":{"heading":"Legal Guidance From Start to Finish","subtitle":"An attorney can provide comprehensive legal guidance, helping to navigate the intricate process of filing insurance claims or lawsuits when necessary.","items":[{"id":"comp1","title":"Legal Guidance From Start to Finish","description":"An attorney can provide comprehensive legal guidance, helping to navigate the intricate process of filing insurance claims or lawsuits when necessary."},{"id":"comp3","title":"Evidence and Expert Support","description":"Attorneys are able to obtain critical evidence, including medical expert testimony, which can help substantiate the severity of your injuries and the impact on your quality of life."},{"id":"comp2","title":"Full Compensation Review and Insurance Negotiation","description":"A lawyer skilled in personal injury cases can negotiate with insurance companies and help calculate the full extent of current and future medical expenses, lost earnings, and pain and suffering associated with amputation injuries."}]}},{"id":"liability-default","type":"liability","title":{"heading":"A loss of limb lawyer provides peace of mind during stressful times by handling all legal proceedings so you can focus on recovery without distraction. From start to finish, an amputation attorney will guide you through your case with care and attention.","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-gray-50"},"data":{"heading":"<span class=\"pad-text-blue\">Common Causes</span> of Amputation Injuries ","subtitle":"Amputation injuries can arise from a variety of circumstances, often resulting in significant physical and emotional consequences for the victims and their families. Common causes include:","items":[{"id":"liability1","term":"Industrial Accidents ","description":"Many amputation injuries occur in industrial settings where heavy machinery and equipment are operated. Workers may experience crush injuries or become caught in machinery, leading to severe injuries that require amputation."},{"id":"liability2","term":"Motor Vehicle Accidents ","description":"Car, truck, and <a href=\"/practice-areas/motorcycle-accidents/\">motorcycle accidents</a> are significant contributors to amputation injuries. High-speed collisions or incidents involving pedestrians can result in traumatic injuries to limbs, often leading to amputation."},{"id":"mr6j3f2wg05v33gg5g","term":"Medical Malpractice ","description":"Instances of medical malpractice can sometimes lead to amputation injuries. Misdiagnosis of infections, improper surgical procedures, or failure to provide timely and adequate treatment can exacerbate injuries, resulting in the loss of limbs. "},{"id":"liability3","term":"Workplace Fails ","description":"<a href=\"/phoenix-workplace-injury-attorney/\">Accidents in workplaces</a> that involve falls, equipment failures, or exposure to hazardous substances can result in serious injuries requiring amputation. Employers must maintain a safe working environment and comply with occupational safety regulations."},{"term":"Animal Attacks ","description":"Dog bites and other animal attacks can lead to severe injuries, sometimes resulting in amputation.<br/><br/>\nIf you or a loved one is facing the devastating consequences of an amputation injury, it is essential to contact an amputation lawyer as soon as possible.","id":"mr6hfwyxecw6pjyol49"}]}},{"id":"mrbxcwcg3rw87ju027v","type":"steps","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"heading":"<span class=\"pad-text-blue\">Liable Parties</span> in Amputation Injury Cases","introText":"In cases of amputation injuries, identifying liable parties is crucial for seeking compensation and holding responsible individuals or entities accountable. Below are the most commonly liable parties:","chevronIconUrl":"","chevronIconId":0,"listType":"ul","accordion":[{"question":"Negligent Drivers ","answer":"Negligent drivers who engage in reckless behavior, such as speeding, distracted driving, or driving under the influence, pose significant risks on the roads. Their actions can directly lead to severe accidents that may result in traumatic injuries, including those requiring amputation. Establishing liability in these cases involves demonstrating the driver’s failure to adhere to traffic laws and exercise reasonable care.","id":"mrbxez5p6gjsyucd8xj"},{"question":"Property Owners ","answer":"Property owners have a legal obligation to maintain safe premises for visitors and guests. When a property is poorly maintained or contains hazards such as uneven walkways, inadequate lighting, or unsafe conditions, owners may be liable for injuries that occur on their property. If negligence leads to an accident resulting in amputation, victims can pursue claims against the responsible property owner through a <a href=\"/phoenix-premises-liability-lawyer/\">premises liability claim</a>.","id":"mrbxf7r0ictv5wwy9oa"},{"question":"Manufacturers and Designers ","answer":"Manufacturers and designers of products have a duty to ensure the safety and efficacy of their items. Defective equipment, machinery, or tools can lead to severe injuries, including amputations if they fail to operate safely. In cases involving product liability, it is essential to demonstrate that the product was flawed in its design or manufacturing, which contributed to the injury.","id":"mrbxfgj5b3d05fr7dqh"},{"question":"Healthcare Providers ","answer":"Healthcare providers, including hospitals, physicians, and surgical teams, are held to high standards of care. When these professionals fail to diagnose conditions, provide appropriate treatment, or follow established medical protocols, <a href=\"https://www.azleg.gov/ars/12/00562.htm\" target=\"_blank\">they may be liable for malpractice</a>. Errors in medical treatment that lead to amputations can result in significant legal claims against the healthcare entities involved.","id":"mrbxflxbva2bdhviez"},{"question":"Government Entities ","answer":"In some cases, government entities may hold responsibility for injuries resulting from unsafe public conditions, such as poorly maintained roads, inadequate safety measures at public facilities, or failure to enforce safety regulations. If negligence by a government agency contributes to an accident resulting in amputation, victims may have legal grounds for seeking compensation.","id":"mrbxfx5cj2jm7baz4ma"}]}},{"id":"mrbxgs43rgtg25fxsk","type":"cta","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"logoUrl":"","logoId":0,"textureUrl":"","textureId":0,"heading":"Start Your Free Consultation","subtext":"If you or a loved one suffered an amputation injury, Hastings & Hastings can help you understand your rights and next steps. Schedule a free consultation with our experienced amputation attorneys to discuss your case and recovery options.","buttonText":"Start your free consultation now!","buttonUrl":"#contact","phoneLabel":"Call Today","phoneNumber":"(480) 480-2929"}},{"id":"attorneys-default","type":"attorneys","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"heading":"<span class=\"pad-text-blue\">Our Accident & Injury Attorneys</span> Can Help","text":"<p>At Hastings and Hastings we understand that amputation injuries can cause life-changing physical and emotional harm. These injuries can range from the loss of a finger or toe, to the loss of an entire limb, or in the worst case — a <a href=\"/practice-areas/wrongful-death/\">fatality</a>. Hastings and Hastings offers over 90 years of combined legal experience in handling all types of accident injuries and we urge you to call now to schedule an appointment to meet with an experienced Phoenix amputation injury attorney.</p>","photoUrl":"","photoId":0,"badgeCards":[{"id":"badge1","imageUrl":"","imageId":0,"description":"You pay nothing upfront and nothing out of pocket. Hastings & Hastings only gets paid if your case results in a recovery."},{"id":"badge2","imageUrl":"","imageId":0,"description":"Hastings & Hastings is known for its 29% settlement fee, giving clients a more affordable way to get experienced legal representation."},{"id":"badge3","imageUrl":"","imageId":0,"description":"Compared to firms that charge 33%, our lower fee structure gives Hastings & Hastings a meaningful cost advantage."}]}}]} /-->

